{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01885","headline":"杂曲歌辞 筑城曲 · 张籍","name":"杂曲歌辞 筑城曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"筑城去，千人万人齐抱杵。\n重重土坚试行锥，军吏执鞭催作迟。\n来时一年深碛里，着尽短衣渴无水。\n力尽不得抛杵声，杵声未定人皆死。\n家家养男当门户，今日作君城下土。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01885.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01885","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}